From f3093d9611b192c5628b9bb97b3e21a6a182944b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 19:35:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 043/211] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: add DMA, UART, I2C and
 SPI controllers

Add the DMA controller and the remaining UART, I2C and SPI controllers,
with the DMA request lines taken from the user manual. Hook the R-I2C
controllers up to the DMA controller as well.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
---
 .../arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 366 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 366 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index 60416e5bf00..38b6f979409 100644
